        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Entry Function Knob for Global Series TH1100EDTBAR</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Entry Function Door Knob (key locks and unlocks lever) for Global <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-wide-door-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-th1100edtbar\"><b>TH1100EDTBAR Touch Bar Rim Exit Devices</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/44-inch-grade-2-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-edtbar44\"><b>Wide Door Touch Bar Rim Exit Devices</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-wide-door-stainless-steel-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-th1100edtbarss\"><b>Stainless Steel Touch Bar Rim Exit Devices</b></a> and other manufactures <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Devices</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWill fit a standard 2-1/8\" bore hole. Removable studs so it works with doors prepared with and with out commercial thru-bolt holes.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for Global TH1100-BALED Keyed Entry Knob\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Function: Entry - Key locks and unlocks the lever. When unlocked turning the lever unlatches the exit devise. </li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish: US26D <b>Satin Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li>Non Handed</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door preps</li>\r\n<li>Standard Schlage \"C\" Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 keys</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
